e also lurking around plus the boss who will pop out if the game goes to long! The player may also fight other warriors to get their items (this is useful if someone else has the target item).", "summary": "Battle Hunter (known as The Hunter in Europe) pits you against evil robots, mutated animals, and even some of your own friends! Battle Cards will help you get a leg up on the competition, and awesome action physics make the gameplay smooth and realistic. If you\u2019re looking for an original challenge that lives up to its premise, check out BATTLE HUNTER.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/battle-hunter", "videos": [{"id": 1739, "name": "Gameplay video", "video_id": "YdbeNzq3Wa4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YdbeNzq3Wa4", "title": "Battle Hunter Game Sample - Playstation", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/YdbeNzq3Wa4/hqdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 8193, "name": "SuperLite 1500"}]}